</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.8</h2><ul><li><strong>A scheduled check notifies you before opening the update window.</strong> Settings → About, under Check automatically: When an update is found defaults to Notify first, and the window opens when that notification is clicked. Show the window opens it immediately. Check for Updates… and Check now still open the window. If notification permission is refused, the window opens so the update is not missed. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/65">#65</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.8">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
